# The first oracle that plays (PLAN.md block 6). Select on NEW GAME, three Selects to type a
# name — an empty name is refused, which is why they are here — then forty detents left to the
# tick (ten a position, analysis/coverage/wheel-probe-*) and Select to accept it. That reaches
# the NEW GAME options screen; Select starts the level. The board is an isometric grid of
# coloured cubes over the underwater backdrop, and nothing touches the wheel from there on, so
# the clock runs the level out on its own.
600: select
900: select
1200: select
1500: select
1800: wheel -40
2000: shot
2200: select
2500: shot
3000: select
3300: shot
4000: shot
5000: shot
5000: quit
